{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58ec79aa9dc5a833d631e","chatId":"e1fb3cce878f4f6b86544e34082d720b","sessionId":null,"userId":95829,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":18969,"promptTokens":2207,"completionTokens":145,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:02:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010986940201801835,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58ec79aa9dc5a833d631d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477767142,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:02:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58ec79aa9dc5a833d631d","chatId":"e1fb3cce878f4f6b86544e34082d720b","sessionId":null,"userId":95829,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n华华和李李是以嘉的好朋友。今天，他们决定去医院探望生病的以嘉。他们去之前没有提前告诉以嘉，华华和李李到了医院时，看到以嘉正坐在医院房间的椅子上，似乎在哭泣。华华先进入房间，向以嘉挥了挥手。看到以嘉的反应有些迟疑，华华冲李李做了个眼神，然后向以嘉微笑。李李看了看华华，然后看了看以嘉，决定在走廊里等一下。\n\n[问题]\n华华为什么冲李李做了一个眼神？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 华华认为李李不该在以嘉床边吵闹，所以冲他做眼神。\nB. 华华感受到以嘉不想要李李来看自己，所以示意李李离开。\nC. 华华想跟李李分享以嘉看起来比想象中好的喜悦。\nD. 华华认为以嘉现在需要安静，决定让李李在走廊里等。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010986940201801835,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58ec79aa9dc5a833d631e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477767139,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:02:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c6314414d81844678414d4ec0a8aa701"}